{"about_the_game":"Explore a real unsolved mystery dating back to antiquity. The Boy Who Typed Wolf is a point &amp; click adventure game filled with unique puzzles, intriguing clues and dark secrets, all based on real events and mythology. Can you solve this enigma?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/848730/extras/2d4f9ace660e45dd7a8e6b570642bab7.avif?t=1742210858\" width=600 height=145 /></span> <br>Explore the secrets of a dark Ancient conundrum. A carefully handcrafted story full of scattered pieces of a much greater enigma based on real historical events and mythology.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/848730/extras/5fa9fddb19c5e4247def3bef8503ebcc.avif?t=1742210858\" width=600 height=145 /></span><br>All puzzles are designed to be interesting, unique and are based on exploration and observation of clues and hints.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/848730/extras/4cfc35329eda615af5fe57f7855578dc.avif?t=1742210858\" width=600 height=145 /></span><br>The shadows hide more than meets the eye, secret rooms and puzzles provide additional layers of challenge and replayability.","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"55dc11063f0c5288da81e9140abdc92ca19ffbb8.jpg","localized_name":"Powered Up","name":"Powered Up","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/848730/55dc11063f0c5288da81e9140abdc92ca19ffbb8.jpg"},{"icon":"a81b398f7a69b07fd390b9b3ba31a23fdc163cf6.jpg","localized_name":"Into the Wolf's Den","name":"Into the Wolf's Den","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/848730/a81b398f7a69b07fd390b9b3ba31a23fdc163cf6.jpg"},{"icon":"0a7c1beeff387bca6533bdf7c6b21a57e06dd4b8.jpg","localized_name":"A Different Forest","name":"A